  "details": "I'd like to be able to use a parameter to control the Volume of an audio source. I know this can be done via animations but it would lower the barrier for entry if it could be done in the script.\n\nAs an example: I've previously put an invisible physbone on my hand with Stretch & Stretch Motion. The stretch parameter now creates a scale for how fast my hand was moving.  I scaled the volume of a punch based on that 0.0-1.0 value.",
